Luna was no ordinary goose. Unlike her flock, who migrated to the south every year, she felt drawn to the stars. One night, while the others slept, she flew higher and higher until the earth was a distant memory. Guided by an unseen force, Luna soared through the atmosphere, past the moon, and into the vastness of space.
